  "description": "The Drifter X is our most all-road oriented gravel platform—designed for riders who want crisp, responsive handling across fast gravel and paved roads alike. With a compact rear triangle, reduced stack height, and high drivetrain stiffness, the Drifter X offers a lively, connected feel whether you're on smooth tarmac or winding dirt.\n\nUpdated for 2025, the Drifter X now fits up to 42mm tires, balancing all-road capability with quick handling and efficient power transfer. It’s built around our No. 6 Composites gravel fork and is available with a fully internal cable routing option via our 3D-printed titanium cockpit system.\n\nThe Drifter X comes standard with a titanium seat mast and our signature 3D-printed topper. Prefer a classic setup? We’ll build yours with a traditional titanium seatpost at no extra charge.\n\nAs with every No. 22, the Drifter X is built to order—crafted in our Upstate New York facility and tailored to your exact fit and build preferences.\n\nFULLY BUTTED TUBE SET TO SHAVE GRAMS AND TUNE RIDE QUALITY\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEAD TUBES AND HEADSETS FOR PRECISE HANDLING AND A SEAMLESS LOOK\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEADSETS COMPLETE WITH ENDURO STAINLESS BEARINGS ARE STANDARD ON ALL FRAMESETS\n\nTITANIUM SEAT MAST TOPPED WITH OUR BESPOKE 3D SINTERED SEAT MAST TOPPER\n\nUDH 3D SINTERED GRADE 5 SEAMLESS TITANIUM DROPOUTS\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT NO. 6 COMPOSITES CARBON FORK INCREASES TIRE CLEARANCE WHILE MAINTAINING PERFORMANCE ORIENTED GEOMETRY\n\nT47 BOTTOM BRACKET FOR MAXIMUM STIFFNESS AND A TIME-TESTED THREADED INTERFACE\n\nA FULL ARRAY OF NO. 22 | PROTOTIPO WORKS BESPOKE HARDWARE",
